        "TileImage": "$($repository a25391c4-a37b-4531-90d4-0af209e7ae83).Image",
        "Description": "Welcome back to the Ark Society, 47.\r\rOur client has engaged our services to eliminate four targets. The Ark Society is one of the most sinister and bizarre environments you will encounter, so you must plan carefully to identify weaknesses in their security.\r\rYour targets are key members of the Ark Society and, as such, tend to stay where security is tightest.\r\rThe targets include known criminals, torturers, and violent individuals. Be vigilant.\r\rGood luck, 47.",
